 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/togaf9-doc/arch/"target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/togaf9-doc/arch/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mac M1上构建docker镜像</title><link>https://nuoyang.tech/tech/other/mac_m1_build_docker_image/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Jan 2023 10:57:00 +0800</pubDate><author>lvatticus@gmail.com (大卓)</author><guid>https://nuoyang.tech/tech/other/mac_m1_build_docker_image/</guid><category domain="https://nuoyang.tech/categories/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/">技术</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在构建docker镜像时遇到&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-gdscript3" data-lang="gdscript3"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;ERROR&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;internal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;load&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;metadata&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;docker&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;io&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;library&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;openjdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;u252&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;jdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;slim&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;直接在mac上拉取镜像发现拉不到，换了一个平台架构发现镜像是存在的&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-gdscript3" data-lang="gdscript3"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;docker&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;pull&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;openjdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;u252&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;jdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;slim&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;--&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;platform&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;linux&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;x86_64&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# 拉取镜像的过程&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;u252&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;jdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;slim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Pulling&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;library&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;openjdk&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;8559&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;a31e96f4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Already&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;exists&lt;/span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;65306&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;eca6b8e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Already&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;exists&lt;/span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;b8f37a6e9e9b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Already&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;exists&lt;/span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;33231475&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;bae0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Already&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;exists&lt;/span&gt; 
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Digest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;sha256&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;3826479&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;f6ca03bbd11e1e12eb78b856f90bf7cea0f534f7204854c82fd89eda2&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Downloaded&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;newer&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;image&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;openjdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;u252&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;jdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;slim&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;docker&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;io&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;library&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;openjdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;u252&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;jdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;slim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;最新的 Docker Desktop for Mac M1 版本，已经为我们集成了一个实验性的工具&lt;strong&gt;buildx&lt;/strong&gt;，通过它，可以编译成各种不同平台架构下的镜像，&lt;strong&gt;buildx&lt;/strong&gt;目前支持的平台架构可以通过命令 &lt;code&gt;docker buildx ls&lt;/code&gt; 来查看&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>vue admin projects collection</title><link>https://nuoyang.tech/tech/other/vue_admin_projects_collection/</link><pubDate>Tue, 02 Aug 2022 16:43:29 +0800</pubDate><author>lvatticus@gmail.com (大卓)</author><guid>https://nuoyang.tech/tech/other/vue_admin_projects_collection/</guid><category domain="https://nuoyang.tech/categories/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/">技术</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="vue-admin-projects-collection"&gt;&lt;span&gt;vue admin projects collection&lt;/span&gt;
